# Dot files
# Ignore all dotfiles except .gitignore itself (which is a dotfile)
# and potentially other important top-level dotfiles like .editorconfig or .travis.yml
.*
!.gitignore
!*.editorconfig
!*.travis.yml
!.gitkeep # if you use this pattern
